---
// Problem.astro
---

<section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50/50 py-24 md:py-32 border-b border-slate-100">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">

    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-50 border border-rose-100 text-xs font-semibold text-rose-600 mb-4 shadow-sm">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500 animate-pulse"></span>
      The Real Ground Reality
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-tight">
      Why Do 90% of Local Websites <span class="text-rose-600">Fail to Bring Customers?</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Having just a digital presence or a Facebook link isn't enough anymore. If your website lacks structure, local customers leave within 3 seconds.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-left">

      <div class="group bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-rose-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-rose-50 text-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-6">01</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-slate-900">Zero Clear Messaging</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
          When a customer lands on your page, do they instantly know what you sell and why they should trust you? If not, they bounce to your competitor.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-amber-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-6">02</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-slate-900">No Direct Call-To-Action (CTA)</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Making users fill out long, boring contact forms kills conversions. Modern customers in Jaipur want an instant WhatsApp click or direct call button.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-blue-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-6">03</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-slate-900">Slow Mobile Loading Speeds</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Over 85% of your local customers are browsing on smartphones over mobile data. Heavy, bloated WordPress templates destroy credibility instantly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-indigo-500 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-6">04</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-slate-900">Invisible on Google Local Searches</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
          If your site isn't structured with clean semantic tags and local SEO metadata, Google won't rank you when nearby clients search for your services.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>